"text","text":"pools. "},{"code":"memberIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"incidentHyperedges(ofIndex:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are stored "},{"code":"ArraySlice<Int>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rows"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read without hashing, and the hypergraph makes a constant number of allocations however many"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices it has. Every vertex-space read hashes its vertex once; index-space reads and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"Hypergraphs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" algorithms hash none."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Hyperedges can be appended but not removed. Equality ignores the order of the vertices and of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the hyperedges.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps from the vertices and the hyperedges to values can be attached (","type":"text"},{"code":"PropertyGraph","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex map is read by vertex index or by vertex, an edge map by hyperedge position.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs"]]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init()","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(hyperedges:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(vertices:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/UndirectedIncidenceList\/init(vertices:hyperedges:)"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/docu